flowchart TD
    subgraph Producer Environment
        Producer[Producer Microservice] --> PMiddleware[Producer Middleware SDK]
        PMiddleware -.->|Build Envelope & Validate| Registry[(AWS EventBridge Schema Registry)]
    end

    subgraph AWS Transport Layer
        PMiddleware -->|Publish Event| EventBridge{Custom Event Bus}
        EventBridge -->|Route per Rule| SQSQueue[SQS Queue Target]
    end

    subgraph Consumer Environment
        SQSQueue --> CMiddleware[Consumer Middleware SDK]
        CMiddleware -.->|Validate Schema| Registry
        CMiddleware <-->|Check & Insert Idempotency| DynamoDB[(DynamoDB Idempotency Store)]
        CMiddleware -.->|Metrics & Tracing| Observability[CloudWatch & X-Ray]
        CMiddleware -->|Execute| Handler[Consumer Handler]
        CMiddleware -.->|On Failure / Max Retries| DLQ[Dead Letter Queue]
    end